## Best Practices

### Do's
- Always use pipelines to prevent data leakage
- Perform proper cross-validation before final evaluation
- Use stratified splits for imbalanced datasets
- Scale features appropriately for distance-based algorithms
- Document feature engineering steps
- Version control your models and preprocessing steps
- Monitor model performance in production

### Don'ts
- Don't fit preprocessors on test data
- Don't use test set for hyperparameter tuning
- Don't ignore class imbalance
- Don't forget to handle missing values
- Don't deploy models without proper validation
- Don't ignore feature importance analysis

This comprehensive guide ensures effective machine learning development with scikit-learn following industry best practices.
